{"parse": {"title": "BBT-01", "pageid": 88296, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><span style=\"display: inline-block; width: 28px;\"></span><span class=\"nav-page-name\">BBT-01</span><a href=\"/wiki/BBT-02\" title=\"BBT-02\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">BBT</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">01</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E5.9C.A8.E8.B7.AF.E4.B8.8A\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"在路上\">在路上</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 在路上</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">On the Road</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>行<span class=\"color-value\"></span>路<span class=\"color-value\"></span>安<span class=\"color-value\"></span>全<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>注<span class=\"color-value\"></span>意<span class=\"color-value\"></span>补<span class=\"color-value\"></span>水<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 192001</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_1_bg_yuanye2.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_1_bg_yuanye2\"><img alt=\"2_1_bg_yuanye2\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/60/Cg-2_1_bg_yuanye2.png/600px-Cg-2_1_bg_yuanye2.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/60/Cg-2_1_bg_yuanye2.png/900px-Cg-2_1_bg_yuanye2.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/60/Cg-2_1_bg_yuanye2.png/1200px-Cg-2_1_bg_yuanye2.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>相信我，APPLe先生，照着这条路走，我们离目的地会越来越近的！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>错误降落的机场？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>坏掉的卡车发动机？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>被石子儿扎坏的摩托轮胎？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>嗨嗨，这一切麻烦都没法阻止我们的脚步！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>摇滚海盗徒步行走在烈日高照的公路上，一步一步，向着遥远的西海岸迈进。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>起初，她背朝着太阳，而后看着自己身下的影子越来越短，又看着影子渐渐从身前转向身后。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>真应该让基金会的呆瓜们看看，本海盗是不可战胜的！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她自夸着，小鹿般轻快的脚步踏过滚烫的石子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>烈日之下，柏油马路延展向遥远的视野尽头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302512.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-302512.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302512.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302512.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-302512.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302512.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-302512.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302512.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>为何她不辞而别，姗然离去～♪</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302512.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-302512.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302512.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302512.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-302512.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302512.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-302512.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302512.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>一定是我说错了什么～♪</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302512.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-302512.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302512.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302512.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-302512.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302512.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-302512.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302512.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>我只好静静等待昨天～♪</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>摇滚海盗哼唱着心爱的曲子，漫步在红色山峦注视下的西部公路。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>船长……你有……东……东西掉了。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_4_at_yewantanxin.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_4_at_yewantanxin\"><img alt=\"2_4_at_yewantanxin\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/Cg-2_4_at_yewantanxin.png/600px-Cg-2_4_at_yewantanxin.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/Cg-2_4_at_yewantanxin.png/900px-Cg-2_4_at_yewantanxin.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/Cg-2_4_at_yewantanxin.png/1200px-Cg-2_4_at_yewantanxin.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一张传送软盘，不知为何从她的背包里掉落出去，跌上滚烫的公路。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>噢——传送软盘，维尔汀的小跟班送给我们的玩具。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>哼哼，基金会的小东西。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她捡起来，拍拍灰，将“失物”收进行囊。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>要是情况不对，我们就用那张基金会的小玩意儿脱身。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>那我们……我们……为什么不用它直接前往洛杉矶呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>比之往常而言，苹果先生似乎有些喘不上气。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>噢！因为我们是在旅行，APPLe先生。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>旅行，航行，就是自己撑着帆，从一个港走向另一个港。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>虽然这儿没有海——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>没有海。只有山，山之外是旷野，旷野之下，工业文明铺就的道路如血管般连接着大陆两侧。 </div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>但想象一下，我们是一艘陆行船！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>旱地行舟，这简直酷得不行！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>摇滚海盗再次掏出软盘——藏在唱片收藏中的基金会术式软盘看起来就像是张平平无奇的碟片。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>转念即次！去影无葱！哈哈！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>术式软盘没有回应错误的咒语。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>船长，APPLe某认为……或许……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他的话有气无力。苹果先生失去了往日的光泽与优雅。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他变得疲惫、干瘪，在热风与烈日的摧折下，坚持漂浮在船长身旁，竭力跟上船长精力充沛的步伐。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>走到海岸之前……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>船长……请……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>想想加州一号公路的灿烂阳光，APPLe先生！我们会赶上演出，体验一场最酷的摇滚大餐！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“船长”有她的雄心壮志——尽管她和她的船员被一张错误的机票送到了错误的地点。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>离开飞机后，外边没有海，只有一座陌生的城市和不友好的市民们。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>身后，苹果先生的速度越来越慢，越来越跟不上船长的脚步。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>请把APPLe某埋在威斯敏斯特桥下……请……</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_1_bg_yuanye2.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_1_bg_yuanye2\"><img alt=\"2_1_bg_yuanye2\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/60/Cg-2_1_bg_yuanye2.png/600px-Cg-2_1_bg_yuanye2.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/60/Cg-2_1_bg_yuanye2.png/900px-Cg-2_1_bg_yuanye2.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/60/Cg-2_1_bg_yuanye2.png/1200px-Cg-2_1_bg_yuanye2.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他话音未落，咕咚一下失去力气，掉落地面。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>柏油公路被热浪晒得滚烫，他的船长匆忙将他“捡起”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>嗨，嗨，APPLe先生，快醒醒——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>APPLe先生——！！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"565220.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/91/HeadIconSmall-565220.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-565220.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"565220.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/91/HeadIconSmall-565220.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-565220.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/91/HeadIconSmall-565220.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-565220.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>你的苹果掉了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>司机摇下车窗。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"565211.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fc/HeadIconSmall-565211.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-565211.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"565211.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fc/HeadIconSmall-565211.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-565211.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fc/HeadIconSmall-565211.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-565211.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>需要载你走一程吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"565201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a4/HeadIconSmall-565201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-565201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"565201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a4/HeadIconSmall-565201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-565201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a4/HeadIconSmall-565201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-565201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>冒着这么大的太阳，徒步荒野可不是件容易事。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"565211.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fc/HeadIconSmall-565211.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-565211.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"565211.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fc/HeadIconSmall-565211.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-565211.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fc/HeadIconSmall-565211.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-565211.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">莱莉：</div><div>我叫莱莉，淘金镇的莱莉。你是名背包客吗？这条路上常有这样的人。你叫什么名字呀？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>热心肠的司机女士停在路边，向摇滚海盗招手示好。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>泰晤士河的“海盗”星锑！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>不过本海盗现在需要一些水……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"565211.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fc/HeadIconSmall-565211.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-565211.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"565211.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fc/HeadIconSmall-565211.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-565211.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fc/HeadIconSmall-565211.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-565211.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">莱莉：</div><div>喏，接住——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>司机女士扔来半空的塑料瓶。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>太好了，这下APPLe先生有救了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>摇滚海盗拧开瓶盖，将剩下的清水浇在伙伴的“身体”上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"565213.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b4/HeadIconSmall-565213.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-565213.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"565213.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b4/HeadIconSmall-565213.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-565213.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b4/HeadIconSmall-565213.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-565213.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">莱莉：</div><div>……你们英国人对食物的态度真是令人难以理解。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>APPLe先生可不是食物。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"565201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a4/HeadIconSmall-565201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-565201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"565201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a4/HeadIconSmall-565201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-565201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a4/HeadIconSmall-565201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-565201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">莱莉：</div><div>好吧，你怎么会出现在这儿？公路边徒步旅行？横穿北美的勇敢背包客？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>一张倒霉的机票把我们送到了错误的地方。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>搭便车的卡车抛锚，摩托撞了仙人掌，连粗脖子老爹开的拖拉机都歇在了半路上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>摇滚海盗这一路霉运不断，像是厄运缠身般频频发生意外。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"565211.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fc/HeadIconSmall-565211.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-565211.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"565211.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fc/HeadIconSmall-565211.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-565211.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fc/HeadIconSmall-565211.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-565211.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">莱莉：</div><div>噗、噗哈哈哈哈！那你可别把我的车也弄坏了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她为陌生人这一连串的倒霉故事而发出笑声。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"565210.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ec/HeadIconSmall-565210.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-565210.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"565210.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ec/HeadIconSmall-565210.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-565210.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ec/HeadIconSmall-565210.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-565210.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">莱莉：</div><div>但你刚才说到……你们？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>司机女士环视周围——这儿只有她和眼前戴墨镜的摇滚海盗，别无他人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>APPLe先生是我最好的船员。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她抱着怀中的苹果——可怜的老伙计在烈日曝晒下依然没有恢复意识。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"565213.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b4/HeadIconSmall-565213.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-565213.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"565213.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b4/HeadIconSmall-565213.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-565213.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b4/HeadIconSmall-565213.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-565213.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">莱莉：</div><div>……好吧，你的苹果朋友看起来状况很糟糕。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"565201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a4/HeadIconSmall-565201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-565201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"565201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a4/HeadIconSmall-565201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-565201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a4/HeadIconSmall-565201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-565201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">莱莉：</div><div>淘金镇就在前面，开车用不了多久。怎么说，小姐，一起吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她按按车喇叭，示意年轻的旅行者上车。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"565201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a4/HeadIconSmall-565201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-565201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"565201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a4/HeadIconSmall-565201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-565201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a4/HeadIconSmall-565201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-565201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">莱莉：</div><div>你如果想找个地方过夜，相信我，一天脚程范围内，你只能选择那儿。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>可我们要去西海岸。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>一个漫长的短休假日，当然应该有沙滩、汽水和摇滚乐！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"565210.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ec/HeadIconSmall-565210.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-565210.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"565210.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ec/HeadIconSmall-565210.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-565210.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ec/HeadIconSmall-565210.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-565210.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">莱莉：</div><div>……通常来说，人们很少会把“漫长”和“短休”两个词放在一块儿用。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"565210.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ec/HeadIconSmall-565210.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-565210.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"565210.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ec/HeadIconSmall-565210.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-565210.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ec/HeadIconSmall-565210.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-565210.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">莱莉：</div><div>从这儿到西海岸，如果一路顺利，再开不了两天就能到。不过现在路况不太好，而且电力供应有些问题。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"565210.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ec/HeadIconSmall-565210.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-565210.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"565210.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ec/HeadIconSmall-565210.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-565210.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ec/HeadIconSmall-565210.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-565210.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">莱莉：</div><div>要是走路的话……算了，没人会步行穿越公路。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"565201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a4/HeadIconSmall-565201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-565201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"565201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a4/HeadIconSmall-565201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-565201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a4/HeadIconSmall-565201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-565201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">莱莉：</div><div>你需要一辆车，或者一个汽车座位。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她拍拍方向盘皮套，像一位骑手骄傲地展示自己座下的爱驹。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"565211.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fc/HeadIconSmall-565211.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-565211.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"565211.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fc/HeadIconSmall-565211.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-565211.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fc/HeadIconSmall-565211.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-565211.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">莱莉：</div><div>上车呗，小姐。我刚替朋友去邻居镇取了东西，回家车上再多个人也没关系。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>司机女士拨开大包小包的杂物，挪出后座座位。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>消毒水的味道让摇滚海盗犹豫了，但片刻过后，她打开车门。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-chenei.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"chenei\"><img alt=\"chenei\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5e/Cg-chenei.png/600px-Cg-chenei.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5e/Cg-chenei.png/900px-Cg-chenei.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5e/Cg-chenei.png/1200px-Cg-chenei.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>有股医院的味道。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她探探鼻子，像好奇的小狮子，闻着车后座的行李中飘出的怪异气味。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"565201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a4/HeadIconSmall-565201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-565201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"565201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a4/HeadIconSmall-565201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-565201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a4/HeadIconSmall-565201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-565201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">莱莉：</div><div>我刚去探望了住院的朋友。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"565211.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fc/HeadIconSmall-565211.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-565211.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"565211.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fc/HeadIconSmall-565211.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-565211.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fc/HeadIconSmall-565211.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-565211.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">莱莉：</div><div>好了，准备出发喽——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"565213.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b4/HeadIconSmall-565213.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-565213.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"565213.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b4/HeadIconSmall-565213.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-565213.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b4/HeadIconSmall-565213.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-565213.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">莱莉：</div><div>嗯？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"565212.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/46/HeadIconSmall-565212.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-565212.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"565212.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/46/HeadIconSmall-565212.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-565212.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/46/HeadIconSmall-565212.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-565212.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">莱莉：</div><div>别这样，伙计，你从没拒绝过任何一位搭车客。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>也许你的伙计不太愉快。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>来点儿音乐让它开心开心？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>对，来点音乐！约翰·列侬的——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>嗷——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>我差点儿撞……！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"565211.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fc/HeadIconSmall-565211.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-565211.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"565211.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fc/HeadIconSmall-565211.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-565211.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fc/HeadIconSmall-565211.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-565211.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">莱莉：</div><div>哈哈哈，坐稳点儿，这车是我老爸的老爸在我老爸结婚的时候买的，体谅体谅老家伙。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "BBT-01"}}